ildlife Walk, Pembroke","network":"lwn","distance":"2.1","operator":"National Trust","description":"Enjoy a stroll through the farms of Folkeston and Trefrane, at the centre of Southwood Estate, where the fields are carefully managed to support wildlife biodiversity. The route includes steep parts, steps, gates and water.","website":"https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/cy/visit/wales/southwood-estate/taith-bywyd-gwyllt-stad-southwood"},2293,[51.83765,-5.11107,51.84111,-5.08777],[156,42,157,158,159,160,161,162,163,164,165,166,167,168,169,170]],[19022282,"f",{"name":"Southwood Estate Coast to Coast Walk, Pembroke","network":"lwn","distance":"4.0","operator":"National Trust","description":"Enjoy sweeping coastal views, wildlife-rich farmland and charming woods on this 2.5-mile circuit around Newgale beach. The route has some sharp gradients, steps, gates and a stream crossing.","website":"https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/cy/visit/wales/southwood-estate/llwybr-arfordir-i-arfordir-stad-southwood"},4486,[51.83826,-5.12141,51.85116,-5.10644],[171,172,173,174,175,176,177,178,179,180,181,182,157,42,156,183,184,185,186,187,44,45,46,188,189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197]],[19093108,"h",{"name":"Porthgain to Abereiddi Coastal Walk, Pembroke","network":"lwn","distance":"6.4","operator":"National Trust","description":"Enjoy some of Pembroke’s finest coastal scenery while exploring its industrial past. Porthgain once exported road stone all over the UK, while Abereiddi’s Blue Lagoon is a former slate quarry. Ynys Barri (or Barry Island), is home to an array of wildlife.","website":"https://www.nationaltrust.org.uk/cy/visit/wales/abereiddi-to-abermawr/llwybr-arfordirol-porthgain-i-abereiddi"},5867,[51.93719,-5.20814,51.9494,-5.17985],[198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220,221,222,223,224,225,226,227,228,229,230,231,232,233,234,235]],[20279882,"h",{"name":"Pembrokeshire Coast Path main route","network":"nwn"},285394,[51.59878,-5.3